# ==============================================================================
# TI C2000 / Code Composer Studio .gitignore
# ==============================================================================

# --- CCS Build Output Directories ---
**/CPU1_RAM/
**/CPU1_FLASH/
**/Debug/
**/Release/

# --- CCS / Eclipse IDE Files ---
# Keep: .ccsproject, .cproject, .project, .settings (needed for CCS build)
# Keep: .clangd (config file, not cache)
# Keep: targetConfigs/ (needed for debug probes)

# --- Theia IDE ---
# Keep: .theia/launch.json (needed for debug configuration)

# --- Compiled Objects & Build Artifacts ---
*.obj
*.out
*.map
*.bin
*.hex
*.lst
*.d
*.opt
*_linkInfo.xml

# --- Clangd Cache ---
.clangd/.cache/
**/.clangd/.cache/

# --- Temporary / Backup Files ---
*.bak
*.tmp
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# --- OS Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editor Files ---
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
